<p>Hey!</p>
<p>
  Your HCB card ending in <%= @card.last4 %> for <%= @event.name %> expires on <strong><%= @expires_on.to_fs(:long) %></strong>.
  After that, it'll stop working and we'll cancel it.
</p>
<p>
  To keep spending, order a replacement from <%= link_to "your card's page", stripe_card_url(@card) %>.
  Your replacement keeps the same card number with a new expiry date and CVC, and we'll try to update your card details at businesses that have it saved.
  Double-check your subscriptions afterwards, since not every business gets the update.
</p>
<% if @card.physical? %>
  <p>Physical cards take about a week to arrive, so order yours soon. Your current card keeps working until it expires or you activate the new one.</p>
<% end %>
<p>Let us know if you have any questions.</p>
<p>—HCB team</p>
